    "text": "Let <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>192</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math> for all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></math> with <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> If <math><mi>m</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></math> then the possible values of m and M are",
